WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.194
- Try cake soup.

00:00:01.194 --> 00:00:02.007
- What's that?

00:00:02.007 --> 00:00:03.006
- It's a recipe I invented.

00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:03.830
- What are you talking about?

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.896
- I'm not a chef, but it's something where

00:00:05.896 --> 00:00:08.834
I take an entire pint
of ice cream, vanilla,

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.505
and then I get a piece of cake,

00:00:10.505 --> 00:00:11.956
and I put it in a bowl, and I just

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:14.475
mash it like a lunatic until it gets

00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:16.205
soupy, and it's called cake soup.

00:00:16.205 --> 00:00:20.564
(funky music)

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.509
Usually, three hours before the show,

00:00:22.509 --> 00:00:23.634
I have a cobb salad, 'cause it's got

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:24.831
protein, greens, everything.

00:00:24.831 --> 00:00:26.792
- Exactly. But three hours before.

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:30.340
- Three hours before, never
at, like, five to showtime.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.521
And then afterwards I
turn into a rabid animal,

00:00:33.521 --> 00:00:36.248
and I never crave, like,
an after show salad.

00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:39.186
So I want a tuna melt,
or pulled pork, or--

00:00:39.186 --> 00:00:40.962
- I've seen you eat a full-on hamburger.

00:00:40.962 --> 00:00:43.702
- Yeah, a full-on
hamburger, fried food, yeah.

00:00:43.702 --> 00:00:46.267
So I admire artists that say, you know,

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:47.997
"I'm just gonna have a
little protein and go to bed.

00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:49.146
"Who's got the tofu?"

00:00:49.146 --> 00:00:50.957
- I do what you do, three hours before,

00:00:50.957 --> 00:00:53.081
it's gotta be like, if
the show's at eight,

00:00:53.081 --> 00:00:54.462
I gotta be, like, 4:35 eating.

00:00:54.462 --> 00:00:55.322
- Exactly. Of course.

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:56.820
- I'll have like a half a turkey sandwich

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.117
with maybe some Popchips,
or I'll have a salad,

00:01:00.117 --> 00:01:02.299
anything that has protein, like you said.

